      "name": "Elyeter — Mobile API",
      "description": "Every endpoint the Elyeter mobile app uses, from elyeter-mobile-api.md.\n\nGetting a token:\n1. Run \"Send code\" (the test number +99362123456 is already in the environment).\n2. Run \"Verify code\" with code 1111.\n3. Copy data.access_token from the response into the access_token environment variable. Every locked request reads it from there.\n\nThe token is good for 30 days; there is no refresh token, so a 401 means running steps 1-3 again.\n\nKnown backend limitations: AliExpress authorization has expired, so both pre-order endpoints answer 503 pre-order-availability-check-failed until an operator re-runs OAuth. SMS only works for the test number. Error messages come back in Russian whatever Content-Language says.",
      "scope": "collection"
    },
