      "description": "Exchanges the code for a 30-day access token. The code is single-use.\n\nCopy data.access_token into the access_token environment variable — every locked request below reads it from there.\n\ndata.is_new tells you the account was just created, which is the moment to ask for a name.\n\nErrors: 400 otp-invalid, 400 otp-too-many-attempts (5 wrong tries burn the code), 404 otp-expired, 403 user-blocked.",
