      "_type": "request",
      "parentId": "fld_preorders",
      "name": "Create pre-order",
      "description": "201 on success. The phone number comes from the token — do not send it.\n\nexpected_total is optional but worth sending: it is what stops a silently higher total. If the re-check disagrees, the order is rejected with 409 pre-order-price-changed rather than created.\n\nThe availability check is always redone here from scratch, whatever an earlier /check said. If anything is missing or short, nothing is created at all — the order is never partially accepted.\n\nBoth 409 bodies carry a /check-shaped details object, so one rendering function can handle check results and checkout rejections alike.",
